  "details": "Being able to get the player's eye-tracking data in Udon would make it possible to develop many wonderful systems and research-oriented features. Referencing the Eye Look field in the VRC Avatar Descriptor Component is one option, but since many users actually rely on VRCFT to enable eye tracking, it should be possible to receive data from both sources. Due to privacy concerns, this feature should only be enabled for users who have opted in via settings.",
